edule of games tonight: Start time, TV channel, where to watch, stream every men's basketball game2026 NCAA tournament Sweet 16 March Madness games tonight, Thursday, March 26(2) Purdue Boilermakers vs. (11) Texas Longhorns, 7:10 p.m. ET, CBS | Preview(4) Nebraska Cornhuskers vs. (9) Iowa Hawkeyes, 7:30 p.m. ET, TBS | Preview(1) Arizona Wildcats vs. (4) Arkansas Razorbacks, 9:45 p.m. ET, CBS | Preview(2) Houston Cougars vs. (3) Illinois Fighting Illini, 10:05 p.m. ET, TBS | PreviewWatch the NCAA Tournament with a Fubo trial2026 NCAA tournament Sweet 16 March Madness games Friday, March 27(1) Duke Blue Devils vs. (5) St. John's Red Storm, 7:10 p.m. ET, CBS | Preview(1) Michigan Wolverines vs. (4) Alabama Crimson Tide, 7:35 p.m. ET, TBS | Preview(2) Connecticut Huskies vs. (3) Michigan State Spartans, 9:45 p.m. ET, CBS | Preview(2) Iowa State Cyclones vs. (6) Tennessee Volunteers, 10:10 p.m. ET, TBS | PreviewWatch the NCAA Tournament on Sling2026 NCAA tournament Sweet 16 round March Madness gamesThursday, March 26, and Friday, March 27.2026 NCAA tournament Elite Eight round March Madness gamesSaturday, March 28, and Sunday, March 29.2026 NCAA tournament Final Four round March Madness games at Lucas Oil Stadium in IndianapolisLucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, 6 p.m. and 8:30 p.m. ET, Saturday, April 4, TBS.March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament championship game at Lucas Oil Stadium in IndianapolisLucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, 8:30 p.m. ET, Monday, April 6, TBS.Watch the Sweet 16 on Sling2026 NCAA tournament odds for March Madness bracket betting: BetMGMVisit www.in.betmgm.com for the latest odds of every NCAA tournament men's basketball game.2026 March Madness bracket picks, predictions for NCAA tournament men's basketballCompare your March Madness bracket to the USA Today experts. See every pick from 10 different brackets.",
